ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/edb896c607cf66b9819f4570923410b8.avif?t=1785751378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras_big/edb896c607cf66b9819f4570923410b8.avif?t=1785751378 width=800 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Race against time to claim ancient treasures, if you dare to venture deep enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Keep your ship afloat together, or join the countless wrecks in the cursed depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/dac0261e8e11cb77504c3c8143304bf3.poster.avif?t=1785751378\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/dac0261e8e11cb77504c3c8143304bf3.webm?t=1785751378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/dac0261e8e11cb77504c3c8143304bf3.mp4?t=1785751378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/15145dd70278f4aa789806361c70b94b.avif?t=1785751378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras_big/15145dd70278f4aa789806361c70b94b.avif?t=1785751378 width=800 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/f7ea8fa0199e470c99245ad03aa1093d.poster.avif?t=1785751378\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/f7ea8fa0199e470c99245ad03aa1093d.webm?t=1785751378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/f7ea8fa0199e470c99245ad03aa1093d.mp4?t=1785751378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these cursed waters, your ship is your only hope of survival. But the Black Armada demands more... Will you risk it all and venture deeper, where priceless treasures await - along with unspeakable horrors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Lurking Horrors:</strong> Every creak, every shadow, every whisper in the dark could be your last warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Your Vessel:</strong> Your only refuge in these cursed waters - keep it intact, or face the horrors of the deep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Ancient Secrets:</strong> Survive each voyage to unlock darker waters and greater rewards - if you dare to return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/40a49330216444adb6cf292db34ddde5.avif?t=1785751378\" width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your crew stand united against the horrors that lurk below, or will the dark waters claim yet another vessel? In these cursed seas, death is merely the beginning.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/352c79689b9d4b57154cb993db9987f8.poster.avif?t=1785751378\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/352c79689b9d4b57154cb993db9987f8.webm?t=1785751378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/352c79689b9d4b57154cb993db9987f8.mp4?t=1785751